  "worked_solution": "Since we need to multiply $\\frac{1}{7}$ by $2$, we repeat the fraction model $2$ times, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14196134/assets/3304c561bf0bbad1b9417e229163456e260e1d5e2022aea9aa275a843f6f12c7.png)\n\n \n\nThere are $2\\times 1=2$ shaded pieces in total. Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{7}\\times 2=\\frac{2}{7}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
